{"articleNo":"968","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=968&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"도서관 일반열람실 좌석관리시스템 운영 변경 알림","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.11.03","hit":"10934","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><font face=\"굴림\"><!--StartFragment--><font size=\"5\">&nbsp;</font><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 48pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><font size=\"4\"><font size=\"5\">[좌석관리시스템 운영 변경 알림]</font><br></font></span><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><font size=\"3\">2009.11.23(월)부터 학생증 바코드 인증 방식으로만 좌석관리시스템을 운영할 계획이오니 기간 내 학생증(바코드)을 반드시 발급 받으시기 바랍니다</font><font size=\"2\">. </font></span></font><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">※<font size=\"2\">학생증이 없거나 바코드가 잘 읽히지 않을 경우 좌석관리시스템 이용불가</font></span> </font>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: #ff00ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt\">◉ 변경사유 : 좌석표 발급시간 단축, 편리한 이용, 대기시간 감소, 학번이용 대리발급 방지, 이용규정위반 및 대리발급자 확인</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><font size=\"2\">※ 학생증&nbsp; 인증 방식 : 학생증 바코드 스캔&nbsp;--&gt;좌석선택</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><font size=\"2\">※ 학&nbsp; 번&nbsp; 입력 방식 : 가상키보드 선택&nbsp;--&gt; 학번입력 --&gt; 패스워드 7자리입력 --&gt; 좌석선택</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"239\" height=\"30\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><font size=\"2\">구 분</font></span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"269\" height=\"30\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><font size=\"2\">발급 장소</font></span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"527\" height=\"30\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><font size=\"2\">발급 대상 </font></span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER