00 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"269\" height=\"55\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><font size=\"2\">도서관 대출실(301호)</font></span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"527\" height=\"55\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;- 학생증이 잘 읽히지 않는 경우<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (바코드 파․오손 등)&nbsp;<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;- 4학년중 학생증이 없는 경우</font></span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: -2.9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 도 서 관 장</span></p>\n</font></div>\n<p></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
